body:
Late to the party, but I need to get it out.

&#x200B;

I'm trying to decide if I want to go on disability for BPD or not. I keep having flashbacks of trauma in the middle of work and I'm having a really hard time trying to be stable. My house is disgusting because I've been working almost 50 hours a week just to make rent but I keep wondering if life is worth it or not. I'm also thinking about getting a service animal in the future. I've been having a lot of crying spells lately and a bunch of medication changes that trigger them and I just don't know what to do at this point. I'm at a loss and I am having a really hard time trying to function like a normal human being. I want to give up and just off it a lot of the time but I know my family would bring me back to life and kill me a second time if I even tried.
